  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Ten of the best players on the planet. Three rules. Only one name survives for the twenty twenty-seven Ballon d'Or.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "THREE RULES",
        "sub": "Ballon d'Or 2027 · early November",
        "pill": "ONE NAME LEFT",
        "person": "kane"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "We start with the real top ten from last month. Harry Kane won it in London, ahead of Mbappé and Yamal.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "podium",
        "year": "2026",
        "title": "Ballon d'Or 2026",
        "places": [
          {
            "person": "kane"
          },
          {
            "person": "mbappe"
          },
          {
            "person": "yamal"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then Rodri, Messi, Kvaratskhelia, Dembélé, Haaland, Olise and Fabián Ruiz.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "2026: places 4 to 10",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "4. Rodri",
            "value": "Man City",
            "club": "mci"
          },
          {
            "name": "5. Lionel Messi",
            "value": "Inter Miami",
            "club": "mia"
          },
          {
            "name": "6. Kvaratskhelia",
            "value": "PSG",
            "club": "psg"
          },
          {
            "name": "7. Ousmane Dembélé",
            "value": "PSG",
            "club": "psg"
          },
          {
            "name": "8. Erling Haaland",
            "value": "Man City",
            "club": "mci"
          },
          {
            "name": "9. Michael Olise",
            "value": "Bayern",
            "club": "bay"
          },
          {
            "name": "10. Fabián Ruiz",
            "value": "PSG",
            "club": "psg"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule one. You have to play your club football in Europe.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 1",
        "body": "Must play club football in Europe this season."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Messi has signed on at Inter Miami until twenty twenty-eight. Thanks for everything, Leo.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "OUT",
        "person": "messi",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule two. Four or more Champions League goals this season, after three matchdays.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 2",
        "body": "Four or more Champions League goals in 2026-27, after matchday three."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Only two of our nine have that. Kane and Haaland, four each. Mbappé is stuck on three.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "UCL goals after matchday 3",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Harry Kane",
            "value": "4",
            "club": "bay",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "Erling Haaland",
            "value": "4",
            "club": "mci",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "Kylian Mbappé",
            "value": "3",
            "club": "rma"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So Mbappé, Yamal, Rodri, Dembélé and the rest are all gone.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "KNOCKED OUT",
        "person": "mbappe",
        "color": "red"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rule three. You can't have won it before. Hungry players only.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "RULE 3",
        "body": "Must never have won the Ballon d'Or."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kane got his golden ball last month. Sorry, Harry.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "ALREADY WON",
        "person": "kane",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That leaves Erling Haaland. Second in twenty twenty-three, and top of the Premier League scoring chart right now.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "haaland",
        "label": "THE LAST NAME LEFT",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Four Champions League goals in only two games, because he sat out matchday three.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Haaland in the UCL",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "4",
            "l": "goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "2",
            "l": "games"
          }
        ],
        "person": "haaland"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The rules say Haaland. Do you agree, or would you pick Kane again?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Who's your pick?",
        "left": {
          "person": "haaland",
          "label": "Haaland",
          "value": "Rules pick"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "kane",
          "label": "Kane",
          "value": "Holder"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
      "scene": {
